<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Excelsior-Henderson gets strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Excelsior-Henderson gets strong buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G. Kinnard &amp; Co analyst Saul Yaari said Monday he began coverage of Excelsior-Henderson Motorcycle Manufacturing Co with a strong buy.</p>
<p>Shares of Excelsior-Henderson were trading off 1/8 to 7-1/8.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
